<ProjectLayout
  title="RTX | Ratier-Figeac"
  category="Experience | Aerospace Methods Engineering"
  year="Feb 2023 | Apr 2023"
  description="Methods engineering internship at RTX | Collins Aerospace in Figeac, focused on REACH-compliant industrial washing, process optimisation, quality control and aerospace documentation."
>

  <p slot="intro">
    A methods engineering experience in the aerospace industry focused on
    industrial washing processes, regulatory compliance, process optimisation
    and quality documentation.
  </p>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      01
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Context
      </h2>

      <p>
        I joined RTX | Collins Aerospace in Figeac as a Methods Engineering Intern,
        working on industrial processes used in aerospace manufacturing.
      </p>

      <p>
        The experience combined process engineering, regulatory compliance,
        quality control and technical documentation within a highly constrained
        industrial environment.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      02
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        REACH-compliant washing process
      </h2>

      <p>
        I contributed to the implementation of an industrial washing process
        compliant with REACH requirements.
      </p>

      <p>
        The objective was to eliminate regulatory risk while maintaining the
        cleaning performance required for aerospace components.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      03
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Process optimisation
      </h2>

      <p>
        I worked on improving the preparation and cleaning sequence of parts
        before subsequent manufacturing or inspection operations.
      </p>

      <p>
        The resulting process reduced part preparation time by a reported 18%
        while also reducing the number of failures during the cleaning steps.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      04
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Aerospace documentation
      </h2>

      <p>
        I produced more than 30 technical documents related to aerospace
        manufacturing, process definition and certification requirements.
      </p>

      <p>
        This work required translating industrial process requirements into
        clear and traceable documentation suitable for a regulated production
        environment.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      05
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Quality control
      </h2>

      <p>
        I contributed to the development of quality control procedures and
        associated decision-making processes.
      </p>

      <p>
        These procedures helped structure the evaluation of cleaning results
        and determine the appropriate action when a process result did not meet
        the expected criteria.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


