    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      07
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Perspective
      </h2>

      <p>
        This experience strengthened my understanding of industrial methods
        engineering and showed how process performance, regulatory compliance
        and quality requirements must be considered together in aerospace
        manufacturing.
      </p>

      <p>
        It also gave me practical experience in turning a technical process
        into a documented, repeatable and auditable industrial method.
      </p>

